  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> be a <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;matrix with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>det</mo><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>. Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></math> denote the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msup></math> row of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>. If a matrix <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> is obtained by performing the operation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math> on <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>det</mo><mfenced><mi>B</mi></mfenced></math> is equal to :"
